##### Decision Variables

- $x_{ij}$: binary, 1 if the van travels directly from node $i$ to node $j$, 0 otherwise, for all $i, j \in \{\text{Depot}, A, B, C\},\, i \neq j$
- $u_i$: integer, position in the tour for $i \in \{A, B, C\}$

